00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.810
You can also set up alerts
for your spending budget.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.440
For example, you could
use Cloud Functions

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:10.160
to enforce and monitor a
compliance S code solution

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.240
to verify names and labels
on provisioned resources,

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.330
and inspect your own IAM
policies and resource

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:20.990
